Package: earthquakes
Title: Query and Explore Earthquake Data from the USGS
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Package","hanuvardhan","hanupavan065@gmail.com",
         "surya", email = "suryavardhan7890@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to query earthquake events
    from the United States Geological
    Survey (USGS), search events near
    a location, calculate great-circle distances,
    identify exploratory spatiotemporal clusters, and map earthquake locations.
